%% sync.run 流式调用（含 progress 事件透传）
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Svelte 前端 (src/routes/sync)
    participant RS as Tauri Rust (ipc_request / IpcClient)
    participant SHELL as tauri-plugin-shell (sidecar)
    participant GO as Go 守护进程 (pkg/ipc Server)
    participant CORE as 核心层 (Syncer)

    User->>UI: 点击「开始同步」
    UI->>RS: invoke('ipc_request', {method:'sync.run', params:{providers?}})
    RS->>SHELL: 若未运行则 sidecar 拉起 cfopt-go serve --ipc-port-file
    SHELL-->>GO: 启动进程
    GO-->>RS: 写入端口文件（单行整数）
    RS->>RS: 读取端口文件 → 配置 IpcClient 地址
    RS->>GO: TCP JSON-RPC {method:"sync.run"}

    loop 测速→提取→写入→各模块同步
        GO->>CORE: Syncer.SyncAll(ctx, cfg, onProgress, providers)
        CORE-->>GO: onProgress(phase,cur,total)
        GO-->>RS: JSON line {method:"progress", params:ProgressEvent}
        RS-->>UI: emit('sync-progress', ProgressEvent)
        UI-->>User: 进度条实时更新
    end

    CORE-->>GO: SyncSummary
    GO-->>RS: JSON line {id, result:SyncSummary}
    RS-->>UI: resolve promise(SyncSummary)
    UI-->>User: 展示汇总（最优 IP/更新/新建/删除/错误）

%% 端口发现 + 进程拉起（细节）
sequenceDiagram
    participant RS as Tauri Rust (daemon.rs)
    participant SHELL as tauri-plugin-shell
    participant FS as 端口文件
    participant GO as cfopt-go serve

    RS->>SHELL: sidecar("cfopt-go").args(["serve","--ipc-addr","127.0.0.1:0","--ipc-port-file",path])
    SHELL->>GO: spawn 进程
    GO->>GO: Listen("127.0.0.1:0") 取得随机端口
    GO->>FS: 原子写 port（tmp+rename）
    RS->>FS: 轮询读取 port（最长 15s）
    FS-->>RS: 54321
    RS->>RS: IpcClient::new("127.0.0.1:54321")

%% config 读取与保存
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Svelte 前端 (src/routes/config)
    participant RS as Tauri Rust (ipc_request)
    participant GO as Go 守护进程 (pkg/ipc Server)
    participant CFG as config 包

    User->>UI: 打开配置页
    UI->>RS: invoke('ipc_request', {method:'config.get'})
    RS->>GO: TCP JSON-RPC {method:"config.get"}
    GO->>CFG: LoadFresh(cfgDir)
    CFG-->>GO: *Config
    GO-->>RS: {result: Config(JSON)}
    RS-->>UI: 渲染表单

    User->>UI: 编辑并保存
    UI->>RS: invoke('ipc_request', {method:'config.save', params: Config})
    RS->>GO: TCP JSON-RPC {method:"config.save", params}
    GO->>CFG: Save(cfgDir, cfg)
    CFG-->>GO: ok
    GO-->>RS: {result:{ok:true}}
    RS-->>UI: 提示已保存
